{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"a1a1a1a1a1a1a1a1","type":"group","x":0,"y":0,"width":520,"height":360,"label":"Project Reading Entry","color":"#DBEAFE"},
		{"id":"a1a1a1a1a1a1a1a2","type":"group","x":560,"y":0,"width":6200,"height":360,"label":"Lane A · Build Stage","color":"#FEF3C7"},
		{"id":"a1a1a1a1a1a1a1a3","type":"group","x":0,"y":420,"width":6200,"height":360,"label":"Lane B · Deploy / Access","color":"#DBEAFE"},
		{"id":"a1a1a1a1a1a1a1a4","type":"group","x":0,"y":840,"width":6200,"height":520,"label":"Lane C · Browser Runtime","color":"#D1FAE5"},
		{"id":"a1a1a1a1a1a1a1a5","type":"group","x":0,"y":1420,"width":6200,"height":360,"label":"Lane D · API Runtime","color":"#FDE68A"},
		{"id":"a1a1a1a1a1a1a1a6","type":"group","x":0,"y":1840,"width":6200,"height":560,"label":"Lane E · Branches / Notes","color":"#E5E7EB"},
		{"id":"b1b1b1b1b1b1b101","type":"file","x":60,"y":60,"width":400,"height":160,"file":"travelKnowledge/我的整理/Vue Components Communication 整理/Build And Runtime 全链路流程图源文档.md","color":"#BFDBFE"},
		{"id":"b1b1b1b1b1b1b102","type":"text","x":60,"y":240,"width":400,"height":80,"text":"## 推荐阅读顺序\n\n1. 先看构建。\n2. 再看部署与访问。\n3. 然后看浏览器首屏渲染。\n4. 最后看 `/api` 业务数据回流。","color":"#E2E8F0"},
		{"id":"b1b1b1b1b1b1b201","type":"text","x":620,"y":80,"width":260,"height":180,"text":"## 开发者提交源码\n\n触发点：Git 提交 / 合并到主分支。","color":"#FDE68A"},
		{"id":"b1b1b1b1b1b1b202","type":"text","x":940,"y":80,"width":260,"height":180,"text":"## 流水线 CI/CD\n\n拉代码、校验、安装依赖、构建、部署。","color":"#FDE68A"},
		{"id":"b1b1b1b1b1b1b203","type":"text","x":1260,"y":80,"width":260,"height":180,"text":"## npm install\n\n安装依赖；构建前置步骤。","color":"#FDE68A"},
		{"id":"b1b1b1b1b1b1b204","type":"text","x":1580,"y":80,"width":260,"height":180,"text":"## npm run build\n\n执行构建脚本；通常调用 vite build。","color":"#FDE68A"},
		{"id":"b1b1b1b1b1b1b205","type":"text","x":1900,"y":80,"width":260,"height":180,"text":"## 构建工具\n\nVite / Rollup / Webpack / esbuild。","color":"#FDE68A"},
		{"id":"b1b1b1b1b1b1b206","type":"text","x":2220,"y":80,"width":260,"height":180,"text":"## 编译阶段\n\nVue/TS/CSS 被编译成浏览器可执行资源。","color":"#FDE68A"},
		{"id":"b1b1b1b1b1b1b207","type":"text","x":2540,"y":80,"width":260,"height":180,"text":"## 优化阶段\n\ntree-shaking、代码分包、资源 hash、压缩。","color":"#FDE68A"},
		{"id":"b1b1b1b1b1b1b208","type":"text","x":2860,"y":80,"width":260,"height":180,"text":"## 生成 dist\n\n输出 index.html、assets/*.js、assets/*.css、图片等。","color":"#FDE68A"},
		{"id":"b1b1b1b1b1b1b301","type":"text","x":60,"y":500,"width":260,"height":180,"text":"## dist（部署视角）\n\n这里开始不再是“怎么打包”，而是“怎么把产物给用户”。","color":"#BFDBFE"},
		{"id":"b1b1b1b1b1b1b302","type":"text","x":380,"y":500,"width":260,"height":180,"text":"## 上传到 Nginx 源站\n\n例如放到 `/var/www/web-example`。","color":"#BFDBFE"},
		{"id":"b1b1b1b1b1b1b303","type":"text","x":700,"y":500,"width":260,"height":180,"text":"## 上传到对象存储 / CDN\n\n云厂商静态资源服务；供 CDN 节点分发。","color":"#BFDBFE"},
		{"id":"b1b1b1b1b1b1b304","type":"text","x":1020,"y":500,"width":260,"height":180,"text":"## 用户输入域名\n\n`web.example.com` 是人能记住的入口。","color":"#BFDBFE"},
		{"id":"b1b1b1b1b1b1b305","type":"text","x":1340,"y":500,"width":260,"height":180,"text":"## DNS 解析\n\n域名 -> IP；可能返回 CDN IP，也可能返回源站 Nginx IP。","color":"#BFDBFE"},
		{"id":"b1b1b1b1b1b1b306","type":"text","x":1660,"y":500,"width":260,"height":180,"text":"## TCP 建连\n\n浏览器根据 IP 建立底层连接。","color":"#BFDBFE"},
		{"id":"b1b1b1b1b1b1b307","type":"text","x":1980,"y":500,"width":260,"height":180,"text":"## TLS 握手（HTTPS）\n\n验证证书、协商会话密钥。","color":"#BFDBFE"},
		{"id":"b1b1b1b1b1b1b308","type":"text","x":2300,"y":500,"width":260,"height":180,"text":"## 发首个 HTTP 请求\n\n请求 `/`、`/home` 或 `index.html`。","color":"#BFDBFE"},
		{"id":"b1b1b1b1b1b1b401","type":"text","x":60,"y":920,"width":260,"height":180,"text":"## Nginx / CDN 返回 index.html\n\n浏览器先拿到 HTML 壳子。","color":"#86EFAC"},
		{"id":"b1b1b1b1b1b1b402","type":"text","x":380,"y":920,"width":260,"height":180,"text":"## 发现 JS / CSS 引用\n\n继续请求 `/assets/*.js` 和 `/assets/*.css`。","color":"#86EFAC"},
		{"id":"b1b1b1b1b1b1b403","type":"text","x":700,"y":920,"width":260,"height":180,"text":"## HTML -> DOM\n\n浏览器把 HTML 解析成 DOM。","color":"#86EFAC"},
		{"id":"b1b1b1b1b1b1b404","type":"text","x":1020,"y":920,"width":260,"height":180,"text":"## CSS -> CSSOM\n\n样式被下载并解析成 CSSOM。","color":"#86EFAC"},
		{"id":"b1b1b1b1b1b1b405","type":"text","x":1340,"y":920,"width":260,"height":180,"text":"## 执行 JS\n\n前端运行时代码开始执行。","color":"#86EFAC"},
		{"id":"b1b1b1b1b1b1b406","type":"text","x":1660,"y":920,"width":260,"height":180,"text":"## Vue createApp\n\n创建应用实例并准备挂载。","color":"#86EFAC"},
		{"id":"b1b1b1b1b1b1b407","type":"text","x":1980,"y":920,"width":260,"height":180,"text":"## 挂载到 #app\n\nVue 接管页面挂载点。","color":"#86EFAC"},
		{"id":"b1b1b1b1b1b1b408","type":"text","x":2300,"y":920,"width":260,"height":180,"text":"## Vue Router 匹配路径\n\n根据当前 URL 选中页面组件。","color":"#86EFAC"},
		{"id":"b1b1b1b1b1b1b409","type":"text","x":2620,"y":920,"width":260,"height":180,"text":"## 组件 -> DOM\n\n页面组件被渲染成真实 DOM。","color":"#86EFAC"},
		{"id":"b1b1b1b1b1b1b410","type":"text","x":2940,"y":920,"width":260,"height":180,"text":"## Render Tree\n\nDOM + CSSOM 形成渲染树。","color":"#86EFAC"},
		{"id":"b1b1b1b1b1b1b411","type":"text","x":3260,"y":920,"width":260,"height":180,"text":"## Layout / Paint / Composite\n\n布局、绘制、合成。","color":"#86EFAC"},
		{"id":"b1b1b1b1b1b1b412","type":"text","x":3580,"y":920,"width":260,"height":180,"text":"## 首屏页面出现\n\n用户看到 Vue 页面壳子。","color":"#86EFAC"},
		{"id":"b1b1b1b1b1b1b501","type":"text","x":60,"y":1500,"width":260,"height":180,"text":"## 页面逻辑触发 API\n\n例如 `axios.get('/api/user')`。","color":"#FCD34D"},
		{"id":"b1b1b1b1b1b1b502","type":"text","x":380,"y":1500,"width":260,"height":180,"text":"## 浏览器发同域请求\n\n浏览器看到的是 `web.example.com/api/user`。","color":"#FCD34D"},
		{"id":"b1b1b1b1b1b1b503","type":"text","x":700,"y":1500,"width":260,"height":180,"text":"## 请求到达 Nginx\n\n不是直接打静态目录，而是先到同域 Nginx。","color":"#FCD34D"},
		{"id":"b1b1b1b1b1b1b504","type":"text","x":1020,"y":1500,"width":260,"height":180,"text":"## 命中 location /api\n\nNginx 识别 API 路径。","color":"#FCD34D"},
		{"id":"b1b1b1b1b1b1b505","type":"text","x":1340,"y":1500,"width":260,"height":180,"text":"## proxy_pass\n\n转发到真实后端 API 服务。","color":"#FCD34D"},
		{"id":"b1b1b1b1b1b1b506","type":"text","x":1660,"y":1500,"width":260,"height":180,"text":"## 后端 API\n\n处理业务逻辑、查数据库、调用服务。","color":"#FCD34D"},
		{"id":"b1b1b1b1b1b1b507","type":"text","x":1980,"y":1500,"width":260,"height":180,"text":"## 返回 JSON\n\n后端响应被 Nginx 带回浏览器。","color":"#FCD34D"},
		{"id":"b1b1b1b1b1b1b508","type":"text","x":2300,"y":1500,"width":260,"height":180,"text":"## Vue 更新状态\n\n写入响应式数据。","color":"#FCD34D"},
		{"id":"b1b1b1b1b1b1b509","type":"text","x":2620,"y":1500,"width":260,"height":180,"text":"## 页面重新渲染\n\n用户看到真实业务数据。","color":"#FCD34D"},
		{"id":"b1b1b1b1b1b1b601","type":"text","x":60,"y":1920,"width":580,"height":170,"text":"## Branch: CDN 命中\n\n浏览器 -> CDN 节点 -> 命中缓存 -> 直接返回 HTML/CSS/JS/图片。","color":"#E2E8F0"},
		{"id":"b1b1b1b1b1b1b602","type":"text","x":700,"y":1920,"width":580,"height":170,"text":"## Branch: CDN 未命中\n\n浏览器 -> CDN 节点 -> 回源 Nginx / 对象存储 -> 缓存 -> 返回资源。","color":"#E2E8F0"},
		{"id":"b1b1b1b1b1b1b603","type":"text","x":1340,"y":1920,"width":580,"height":170,"text":"## Branch: SPA 路由回退\n\nhistory 模式刷新 `/home` 时，`try_files $uri $uri/ /index.html` 避免 404。","color":"#E2E8F0"},
		{"id":"b1b1b1b1b1b1b604","type":"text","x":1980,"y":1920,"width":580,"height":170,"text":"## Nginx 三个职责\n\n静态资源服务器、SPA 路由兜底、反向代理 `/api`。","color":"#FCA5A5"},
		{"id":"b1b1b1b1b1b1b605","type":"text","x":2620,"y":1920,"width":580,"height":170,"text":"## 反向代理 vs 跨域\n\n浏览器只访问同域；Nginx 在服务端内部转发到真实 API。","color":"#FCA5A5"},
		{"id":"b1b1b1b1b1b1b606","type":"text","x":3260,"y":1920,"width":580,"height":170,"text":"## HTTP / HTTPS / TCP/IP\n\nDNS 找 IP -> TCP 建连 -> TLS 握手 -> HTTP 请求与响应。","color":"#FCA5A5"},
		{"id":"b1b1b1b1b1b1b607","type":"text","x":3900,"y":1920,"width":580,"height":170,"text":"## Where To Modify\n\n改构建看 `package.json` / Vite；改部署看 Nginx；改接口看 `location /api`。","color":"#FCA5A5"}
	],
	"edges":[
		{"id":"e1e1e1e1e1e1e201","fromNode":"b1b1b1b1b1b1b201","fromSide":"right","toNode":"b1b1b1b1b1b1b202","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"提交","color":"#64748B"},
